  ~|  'twilight-sign-out-of-bounds'                     ::  15-sign wheel!
  ?>  &(gte(current-sign 1) lte(current-sign 15))
  ?:  (eql current-sign 15)  1  +(current-sign)         ::  Siya -> Aries!
